ount":4,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-08T13:17:51.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-09T02:33:58.000Z","latest":"马斯克称Grok Bot明日将大幅改进","digest":"xAI 正在修复 Grok Bot 的 token 效率与行为问题。Elon Musk 先在其 X 账号称相关修复“正在进行中”；Grok Bot 相关账号 @mattyp 随后发帖称 token 效率与行为方面的改进正在进行，并请用户在该帖下回复反馈，称会全部阅读。\n\n11 月 9 日，Musk 称刚与 Grok @Bot 工程团队做完复盘，修复正在连夜实施，用户“明天应该会看到显著改善”；若未见改善，可回复该帖，团队会立即处理剩余问题。\n\n目前未披露修复的具体内容、适用范围、完成时间，也没有效率提升幅度的数据；“显著改善”是 Musk 的预期，尚未得到验证。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-09T02:54:52.309Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/story/0d0f5f1f-b3ea-4b0f-bd3c-f6735cd0b4dc"},"reports":[{"id":"on03qbwvmdyls4kpua3dnftte","title":"马斯克称Grok Bot明日将大幅改进","summary":"Grok @Bot 明天将迎来“大幅改进”","source":{"name":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T02:33:58.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/on03qbwvmdyls4kpua3dnftte","original":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2119619475725287899"}},{"id":"q9k7bderhyy5bj6s2x5tsint3","title":"Grok Bot 工程团队连夜修复问题","summary":"刚和 Grok @Bot 工程团队做了一轮圆桌复盘。\n\n修复正在连夜实施，明天你应该会看到显著改善。如果没有，请回复这条帖子，我们会立即处理剩余问题。","source":{"name":"X：Elon Musk (@elonmusk, xAI)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T02:25:56.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/q9k7bderhyy5bj6s2x5tsint3","original":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2119617455102333206"}},{"id":"bw4baps8s31nkvszvq8qmltzb","title":"Grok Bot 改进 token 效率与行为","summary":"Grok Bot 在 token 效率与行为方面的改进正在进行中\n\n你们许多人在 @bot 上构建了重要的工作流——我们希望继续支持你们\n\n请在这条帖子下回复反馈。我会全部阅读\n\n衷心感谢你们的支持","source":{"name":"X：Matt Palmer（SpaceXSI，Grok Bot） (@mattyp)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-08T16:58:17.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https://aihot.news/items/bw4baps8s31nkvszvq8qmltzb","original":"https://x.com/mattyp/status/2119474599708827957"}},{"id":"svii78aucgrcj4ccd1gzmtsq0","title":"xAI 正在改进 Grok Bot 的 token 效率","summary":"旨在提升 token 效率和更智能行为的 Grok Bot 修复正在进行中","source":{"name":"X：Elon Musk (@elonmusk, xAI)","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-08T13:17:51.000Z","links":{"aihot":"https: